Also note the `_frame_transparency` is set only in the else branch (frame != 0). For frame 0, transparency is set in self.info["transparency"].

Fix in `_seek` frame == 0 branch:

```python
if frame == 0:
    if self._frame_palette:
        if LOADING_STRATEGY == LoadingStrategy.RGB_ALWAYS:
            self.mode = "RGBA" if frame_transparency is not None else "RGB"
        else:
            self.mode = "P"
    else:
        self.mode = "L"
```

